          "href": "https://help.klaviyo.com/hc/en-us/articles/360049968412-Understanding-account-notifications-and-updates-in-Klaviyo#h_01JDMW8JSDZ04AX1SGXD3YEJKD",
          "text": "You will learn"
        },
        {
          "href": "https://help.klaviyo.com/hc/en-us/articles/360049968412-Understanding-account-notifications-and-updates-in-Klaviyo#h_01JDMW8JSD5D6BRN61QFQY5YMJ",
          "text": "Email updates"
